flowchart LR
  U[Authenticated user] --> C[User-owned endpoint configuration]
  C --> P[Application destination validation]
  P --> B[Backend and worker]
  B --> G[Outbound egress gateway]
  A[Administrator policy and credentials] --> G
  G --> N[Approved network destinations]
  D[Default-deny direct egress] -. blocks .-> B
  O[OIDC provider] --> F[Next.js auth]
  CA[Scoped CA or public PKI] --> F
